# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#   Maze Navigator Example (.rcl)
#   Demonstrates precise multi-turn navigation
# ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

speed 7

# Enter maze corridor 1
move forward 3 steps
turn left 90 degrees

# Corridor 2
move forward 4 steps
turn right 90 degrees

# Corridor 3
move forward 2 steps
turn right 90 degrees

# Corridor 4
move forward 4 steps
turn left 90 degrees

# Exit corridor & boost
move forward 3 steps
ability "boost"

# End navigation
stop
